    "Cost": 858121,
    "UIName": "Jackal",
    "Id": "chassisdef_jackal_JA-KL-1532",
    "Name": "Jackal",
    "Details": "The Jackal JA-KL-1532 was armed with a simple but effective arsenal. The primary weapon carried by the 'Mech is an ER PPC, which allowed the Jackal to damage a target at just under 700 meters, while a Streak SRM-2 missile launcher provided close combat power. An anti-missile system was mounted on the 'Mech's head for missile defense; each system carried a ton of ammunition.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - PPC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_jackal"
  },
  "VariantName": "JA-KL-1532",
